IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LFM-WFL-CONTINUOUS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-DT-SCALED         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-TIME-STATE.
   05 D1-CURRENT-T         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-NONCE-X-T         PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-DYNAMIC-INTEGRAL.
   05 D2-FORWARD-U-T       PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-BACK-V-T          PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-SYMM-PROD-T       PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-SYMM-QUOT-T       PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-TOTIENT-T         PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.

    PERFORM COMPUTE-CONTINUOUS-STEP-T.
    
    comment INVARIANT PROOF: Totient(t) = Modpow(u(t), v(t), u(t)) = 0 for every t;
    IF D2-TOTIENT-T == 0 AND D2-SYMM-PROD-T > 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 2 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

COMPUTE-CONTINUOUS-STEP-T.
    COMPUTE D2-SYMM-PROD-T = D2-FORWARD-U-T + D2-BACK-V-T.
    IF D2-BACK-V-T >= D2-FORWARD-U-T
        COMPUTE D2-SYMM-QUOT-T = D2-BACK-V-T - D2-FORWARD-U-T
    ELSE
        COMPUTE D2-SYMM-QUOT-T = D2-FORWARD-U-T - D2-BACK-V-T
    END-IF.
    
    comment Modpow(u(t), v(t), u(t)) is identically 0 for all u(t) > 0, v(t) >= 1;
    MOVE 0 TO D2-TOTIENT-T.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-SYMM-QUOT-T - ((D2-SYMM-QUOT-T / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
